# Portable calculation — actual Chrome acceptance

Final result: **12/12 browser case groups and 42/42 observer negative controls
passed** in actual Chrome 152.0.7977.83. Chrome precise coverage recorded exactly
one call each to `computePortableChart`, public `natalChart`, internal
`computeChart`, and `createNatalEnvelope` for the separately measured calculation.
Neither the calculator nor receipt creator was replaced by a mock or wrapper.

Final run: `run-1788841898123-18336`, completed 2026-09-08T04:31:39.492Z.
